The client rated the work **5.0 on Upwork** and endorsed it as *Committed to Quality* and *Detail Oriented*. The brief came from an experienced hirer: 72 reviews and more than 118 hires on the platform. Today the bot coaches young entrepreneurs in Uganda every day: recording their sales and profit at 7 pm, answering business questions in their own language, and making sure anyone who is struggling reaches a person.
